{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The sun</b> — it tells of darkenings that the sun will have when it conjoins with the moon, and the moon will darken and become red. This will occur when it is far from the head of the Tail and its tail is near within six degrees. They are always signs of wars, and it was a sign that many nations would die."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:38.251490667Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}